---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Word And Mouth | The Internal Insurrection" description="The experts are already inside your building. Unlock them.">
  <div class="insurrection-container">
    
    <!-- SECTION 1: THE STOP -->
    <header class="hero-block">
      <h1 class="glitch-text">WINNING<br>FEELS IMPOSSIBLE.</h1>
      <p class="hero-answer">
        You've put in the hours.<br>
        But those big goals are still out of reach.<br>
        And you're out of ideas.
      </p>
      
      <p class="suffered-text">You've suffered enough.</p>
      
      <div class="hero-cta-group">
        <p class="cta-pre">Time to get out of the discomfort zone.</p>
        <a href="#manifesto" class="text-link">Enter The Maverick Mindset ↓</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- SECTION 2: THE TRUTH -->
    <section class="manifesto-block red-border" id="manifesto">
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <span class="system-label">THE RESEARCH</span>
        <h2>The Odds Are Against You.</h2>
        <div class="stat-row">
          <div class="stat-item">
            <span class="stat-number">67%</span>
            <span class="stat-desc">of strategies fail to launch (HBR)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-item">
            <span class="stat-number">40%</span>
            <span class="stat-desc">of value is lost in execution (Bain)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="lead-text">
          You don't need another consultant showing you slides. You need a <strong>Special Projects Team</strong>: an autonomous unit designed to break rules, move fast, and fix the things your bureaucracy cannot touch.
        </p>
        <p class="highlight-text">
          You need the Maverick Mindset.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 4: THE 5 PILLARS (WITH PROOF) -->
    <section class="pillars-block">
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <span class="system-label">THE CONFIGURATION</span>
        <h3>The 5 Pillars of the Machine</h3>
        <p class="pillars-intro">Innovation isn't magic. It's engineering. We have mapped the 5 nodes you must configure to build a team that actually ships.</p>
        
        <div class="pillars-grid">
          
          <!-- PILLAR 01: HIRING -->
          <div class="pillar-card">
            <span class="pillar-num">01</span>
            <h4>HIRING</h4>
            <p class="pillar-sub">Recruiting Pirates</p>
            <p class="pillar-desc">
              Standard HR screens out "Positive Deviants." You need to find the polymaths and the obsessive tinkerers.
            </p>
            <div class="pillar-proof">
              <span class="proof-label">SEE THE FRAMEWORK:</span>
              <a href="/solved/room-40" class="proof-link">Room 40: The Talent Algorithm →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- PILLAR 02: COACHING -->
          <div class="pillar-card">
            <span class="pillar-num">02</span>
            <h4>COACHING</h4>
            <p class="pillar-sub">Maverick Deprogramming</p>
            <p class="pillar-desc">
              Managers kill innovation by accident. Leaders must be deprogrammed to shield chaos, not control it.
            </p>
            <div class="pillar-proof">
              <span class="proof-label">SEE THE FRAMEWORK:</span>
              <a href="/solved/universal-coaching" class="proof-link">The Universal Coaching Model →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- PILLAR 03: EXECUTION -->
          <div class="pillar-card">
            <span class="pillar-num">03</span>
            <h4>EXECUTION</h4>
            <p class="pillar-sub">The 100-Day War</p>
            <p class="pillar-desc">
              Speed is the only moat. We use "Process Audits" to strip away the fat and AI agents to do the grunt work.
            </p>
            <div class="pillar-proof">
              <span class="proof-label">SEE THE FRAMEWORK:</span>
              <a href="/rabbit-holes/process-audit" class="proof-link">The 72-Hour Process Audit →</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- PILLAR 04: STRUCTURE -->
          <div class="pillar-card">
            <span class="pillar-num">04</span>
            <h4>STRUCTURE</h4>
            <p class="pillar-sub">The Air Gap</p>
            <p class="pillar-desc">
              If the team is too close to the Core, it dies. You need a "Sandbox" where rules can be broken safely.
            </p>
            <div class="pillar-proof">
              <span class="proof-label">SEE THE FRAMEWORK:</span>
              <a href="/solved/enterprise-sandbox" class="proof-link">The Enterprise Sandbox →</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- PILLAR 05: ENVIRONMENT -->
          <div class="pillar-card">
            <span class="pillar-num">05</span>
            <h4>ENVIRONMENT</h4>
            <p class="pillar-sub">Psychological Safety</p>
            <p class="pillar-desc">
              Communication is the nervous system. If truth can't move fast, the organism dies.
            </p>
            <div class="pillar-proof">
              <span class="proof-label">SEE THE FRAMEWORK:</span>
              <a href="/solved/internal-comms-2026" class="proof-link">Internal Comms 2026 →</a>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 5: BELEAF (PROOF) -->
    <section class="beleaf-block">
      <div class="content-wrapper">
        <span class="system-label">THE PROOF</span>
        <h2>We Don't Guess. We Test.</h2>
        <div class="beleaf-content">
          <div class="beleaf-text">
            <p>
              Most consultants sell you theory. We run a simulation.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>Meet BeLeaf.</strong>
            </p>
            <p>
              BeLeaf is our synthetic organization. A fully-realized tea & coffee company with 149 employees, real revenue models, and messy problems. 
            </p>
            <p>
              Before we ever touch your business, we test our Hiring protocols, AI agents, and Execution frameworks on BeLeaf. If it breaks there, you never see it.
            </p>
            <a href="/beleaf" class="beleaf-btn">Enter The Laboratory →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="beleaf-visual">
             <div class="beleaf-card">
               <span class="b-icon">🍃</span>
               <span class="b-name">BeLeaf Ltd.</span>
               <span class="b-stat">Synthetic Subject #001</span>
             </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 6: THE ASK -->
    <section class="ask-block">
      <div class="ask-grid">
        <div class="ask-card">
          <h4>For Leaders</h4>
          <p>Build the Unit.</p>
          <a href="/consulting" class="action-btn">Deploy a Special Projects Team →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="ask-card">
          <h4>For SMBs</h4>
          <p>Adopt the Mindset.</p>
          <a href="/mission" class="action-btn">Get The Blueprints →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="ask-card">
          <h4>For Organisers</h4>
          <p>Book The Wake-Up Call.</p>
          <a href="/speaking" class="action-btn">Book Dave Keynote →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .insurrection-container {
    background: #000;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  .content-wrapper {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  /* TYPOGRAPHY */
  h1, h2, h3, h4 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .system-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent);
    display: inline-block;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* HERO */
  .hero-block {
    min-height: 90vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 8rem 2rem 4rem; /* Increased top padding for fixed header */
    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #111 0%, #000 70%);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1; /* Ensure it doesn't float above everything */
  }

  .glitch-text {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 8rem);
    line-height: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    color: #fff;
    text-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--accent);
  }

  .hero-answer {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #ccc;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .suffered-text {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  
  .cta-pre {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  /* MANIFESTO */
  .manifesto-block {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #0a0a0a;
  }

  .red-border {
    border-left: 10px solid var(--accent);
  }

  .manifesto-block h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .lead-text {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: #bbb;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .highlight-text {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    border-left: 4px solid #fff;
    padding-left: 2rem;
  }

  /* SOLUTION */
  .solution-block {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    text-align: center;
    background: #050505;
  }

  .solution-block h2 {
    font-size: 4rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .solution-block p {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: #ccc;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* PILLARS (TEXT EXPLOSION) */
  .pillars-block {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #000;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
  }

  .pillars-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .pillar-card {
    border-left: 1px solid #333;
    padding-left: 2rem;
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .pillar-card:last-child {
    border-left: none;
    padding-left: 2rem; /* Keep padding for alignment */
    border-left: 1px solid transparent; /* Maintain spacing */
  }
  
  /* Create a visual timeline/flow effect */
  .pillar-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -5px;
    top: 0;
    width: 9px;
    height: 9px;
    background: var(--accent);
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .pillar-num {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', monospace;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .pillar-card h4 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .pillar-sub {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', monospace;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
    display: inline-block;
    padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .pillar-desc {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #aaa;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .pillar-proof {
    background: #111;
    border: 1px solid #333;
    padding: 1rem;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .proof-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .proof-link {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .proof-link:hover {
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* BELEAF */
  .beleaf-block {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    background: #0a0a0a;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
  }

  .beleaf-content {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .beleaf-content { flex-direction: column; }
  }

  .beleaf-text {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .beleaf-text p {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #ccc;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .beleaf-visual {
    flex: 0 0 300px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .beleaf-card {
    background: #151515;
    padding: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid #333;
    transform: rotate(3deg);
    transition: transform 0.3s;
  }

  .beleaf-card:hover {
    transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1.05);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .b-icon { font-size: 4rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .b-name { display: block; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .b-stat { display: block; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }

  .beleaf-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    border: 1px solid #fff;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .beleaf-btn:hover {
    background: #fff;
    color: #000;
  }
  
  /* STATS ROW */
  .stat-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  
  .stat-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  
  .stat-number {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  
  .stat-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #888;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* ASK */
  .ask-block {
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
    background: #000;
  }

  .ask-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ask-card {
    background: #111;
    border: 1px solid #333;
    padding: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .ask-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-10px);
  }

  .ask-card h4 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .ask-card p {
    color: #888;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    min-height: 3rem;
  }

  .action-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    background: #fff;
    color: #000;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .action-btn:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
  }

</style>
